WEBVTT

00:11:58.662 --> 00:12:02.954
show this to be the best path for success.

00:12:06.829 --> 00:12:11.537
But now our society is reaching
a new tipping point.

00:12:12.662 --> 00:12:13.996
Inequities,

00:12:14.037 --> 00:12:16.662
racism and bigotry

00:12:16.704 --> 00:12:19.746
are finding fewer places to cower.

00:12:20.996 --> 00:12:24.787
Silences are becoming harder to keep.

00:12:26.496 --> 00:12:30.996
Our most radical collective
imaginations for racial justice